    <item>
      <title>“香蕉”终于扒皮了！谷歌认领“AI版Photoshop”，网友：P图自由要来了？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aiphotoshopp-20250827154004720-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 27 Aug 2025 15:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
